<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Bossa Nova Nylon Feel" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A soft, close, dark clean that leans toward nylon-string warmth for bossa comping: the compressor rounds off the pick attack, a solid-state 2x12 runs with treble low and mids up, the top is shelved away and the room is tiny. Fingerstyle thumb-and-fingers; keep the bass notes light." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
