<headroom-library version="1" id="clean-bossa-nylon" category="Clean" order="210" instrument="guitar" style="Latin / Bossa">
  <description>A soft, close, dark clean that leans toward nylon-string warmth for bossa comping: the compressor rounds off the pick attack, a solid-state 2x12 runs with treble low and mids up, the top is shelved away and the room is tiny. Fingerstyle thumb-and-fingers; keep the bass notes light.</description>
  <tags><tag>Clean</tag><tag>Latin / Bossa</tag><tag>Jazz</tag><tag>Warm</tag><tag>Compressed</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.jazzguitar.be/forum/guitar-amps-gizmos/100045-good-guitar-tone-electric-bossa-nova.html" title="jazzguitar.be forum: good guitar tone for electric bossa nova"/>
    <source url="https://www.jazzguitar.be/forum/guitar-amps-gizmos/44260-bossa-nova-guitar.html" title="jazzguitar.be forum: bossa nova guitar"/>
    <source url="https://guitargear.net.au/articles/neck-pickup-wiring-archtops-tone-control" title="Guitar Gear: neck pickup wiring for archtops, why the tone control does more work"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
